ation","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb.proj_V_idem","kind":"theorem","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-unique.lean#L57-L57","doc":"**Kernel**: `π_V` idempotent. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalReeb.normalisation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb.normalisation","kind":"theorem","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-unique.lean#L55-L55","doc":"**Normalisation**: `ξ ≫ θ_A = θ_A`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalReeb.vertical_generator","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb.vertical_generator","kind":"theorem","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-unique.lean#L53-L53","doc":"**Vertical generator**: `d ≫ π_V ≫ ι_ξ = ξ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalReeb.contract_xi","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb.contract_xi","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-unique.lean#L51-L51","doc":"The interior product (contraction) `ι_ξ : Ω¹(A) → A`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalReeb.d","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb.d","kind":"def","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-unique.lean#L49-L49","doc":"The differential `d : A → Ω¹(A)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalReeb.proj_V","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb.proj_V","kind":"def","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-unique.lean#L47-L47","doc":"The vertical projection `π_V : Ω¹(A) → Ω¹(A)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalReeb.theta","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb.theta","kind":"def","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-unique.lean#L45-L45","doc":"The canonical 1-form `θ_A`, abstractly a morphism `A → 𝟙`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalReeb.xi","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb.xi","kind":"def","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-unique.lean#L43-L43","doc":"The Reeb derivation `ξ : A → A`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalReeb.forms","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb.forms","kind":"def","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-unique.lean#L41-L41","doc":"The object of 1-forms `Ω¹(A)` in `C`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalReeb.A","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb.A","kind":"def","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-unique.lean#L39-L39","doc":"The Frobenius–Hopf object `A`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalReeb.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb.mk","kind":"ctor","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-unique.lean#L36-L36","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalReeb","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb","kind":"structure","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-unique.lean#L30-L59","doc":"**Categorical Reeb derivation** (inlined for standalone compilation;\ncanonical definition lives in `categorical-reeb.lean`).\n\nThe endomorphism `ξ : A → A` generating the `T`-action on the\nFrobenius–Hopf object `A`, equipped with a canonical 1-form `θ_A`\nsatisfying the vertical-generator, normalisation, and kernel axioms. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:categorical-reeb","label":"def:categorical-reeb","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}